# Shared strop rules (cursor-packs)

When bootstrapping strop, choosing composition/refinement APIs, or debugging loop exits:

- Load `.cursor/skills/strop-orchestration/SKILL.md`.

When adding a pipeline job, clients, modules, evaluators, or aligning to JobRunner:

- Load `.cursor/skills/strop-pipeline-pattern/SKILL.md`.
- If the project has a local overlay (e.g. `pipeline-client-module-pattern`), load it **after** the pack skill for product-specific paths.

When implementing human review, Gate, reject-and-regenerate, or reviewflow ports:

- Load `.cursor/skills/strop-human-review/SKILL.md`.
- If the project has a local overlay (e.g. `human-review-flow`), load it for product CLI/classroom details.

When working on XML structured output or parser alignment:

- Load `.cursor/skills/dspy-xml-structured-output/SKILL.md`.
- If the project has phased-composition hooks, load its local XML overlay if present.

Module wiring and prompts: see `.cursor/rules/dspy.mdc`.
